{"game": "back-4-blood", "language": "english", "appid": 924970, "month": "2024-01", "window": 3, "start_date": 1705363200, "end_date": 1706054399, "month_true_total": 349, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 20:51:29 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "156642901", "author": {"steamid": "76561198856247843", "personaname": "zen", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198856247843/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 1809, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1807, "last_played": 1721877957, "avatar": "cca14dbeb250ad621f8446ee0e4c609a6bc9d908"}, "language": "english", "review": "Playing steam games for years and never purchased a pre-order until this game released ! Such a noob to buy this game at such price with no update anymore from official announcement. Nothing to say but speechless .... disappointment ...", "timestamp_created": 1706031259, "timestamp_updated": 1706031259, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 18, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.545019805431365967", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 19, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "156622445", "author": {"steamid": "76561199130476049", "personaname": "WhatAHorribleNight", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199130476049/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 2609, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2608, "last_played": 1706116677, "avatar": "fd6fed4d67922b8c6ae65dd80a082e72fb4521f7"}, "language": "english", "review": "Left 4 Dead with a class system and deck building. It's fun af.", "timestamp_created": 1706012075, "timestamp_updated": 1706012075, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.476190477609634399", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "156622372", "author": {"steamid": "76561198131274764", "personaname": "Pvt.Bokchoy1001", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/PvtBokchoy/", "num_games_owned": 452, "num_reviews": 124, "playtime_forever": 2684, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1913, "last_played": 1707221076, "avatar": "c26286f1a292309692f9a3a04eed8e0b8c15c66b"}, "language": "english", "review": "Turtle Rock's biggest mistake was advertising themselves as \"The creators of left 4 dead\" \nYou know that 1 guy in a group presentation that does 1 slide and nothing else and everyone else carried him to an outstanding victory and that 1 guy goes on to boasting how well they did. That guy is Turtle Rock Studios.\n\nThat being said when I look at the game and not think 'left 4 dead' its not as terrible as everyone says. \nI enjoy the faster paced gameplay this game has. \nThe card system while disfavouring new comers, allows for more variety and experimentation with builds and setups. \nAttachments that add extra flavour to the gun and build you have\nVendors that further give agency to the player to make a build that suits their play style \nLots of different firearms and weapons to choose from\nNice visuals \n\nOn the other hand theres a lot of downsides this game has.\nCharacters are bland\nCharacter interaction is bland \nAnimations are poor\nGun sound effects are bad, they don't sound like guns and many sound weak\nHad some enemies spawn in LOS \nHuge numbers of specials and zombie spawns especially at the higher difficulties\n\nIts not terrible but not exceptional. Pick up only when on sale. Absolutely not worthy at full price.\nA solid 6.7/10", "timestamp_created": 1706011990, "timestamp_updated": 1706011990, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "156617160", "author": {"steamid": "76561199200428637", "personaname": "FloralRabbit29", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199200428637/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 1528, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1316, "last_played": 1741011378, "avatar": "050506265d24471fed6a309f055c1280871f4173"}, "language": "english", "review": "Really fun, don't understand why so much negativity towards this game.", "timestamp_created": 1706006767, "timestamp_updated": 1706006767, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "156608569", "author": {"steamid": "76561198145493882", "personaname": "Arunirai", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Passtryn/", "num_games_owned": 122, "num_reviews": 28, "playtime_forever": 1469, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1469, "last_played": 1705994307, "avatar": "edea68afd57a75255af47916521ba7b4bd0174c1"}, "language": "english", "review": "little bit Buggy is okay, but it's not Left 4 Dead 3,4,Etc, the player are just Left it 4 Dead FR,FR", "timestamp_created": 1705994617, "timestamp_updated": 1705994617, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.483870983123779297", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": 